 <h3><u>Mubarak ho ye shaadi</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Mubarak mubarak<br> Mubarak ho yeh shaadi....x4<br> Mubarak<br> Jahan shaadi ki mehfil ho kaside ham sunate hain..x3<br> Jahan shaadi ki mehfil ho.....<br> Jahan shaadi ki mehfil ho kaside hum sunate hain<br> Mubarak ho......x2<br> Ali ke chahnewale khushi aise manate hain<br> Jahan....x2</p> 
  <p>Wilawaley yaha par hain,wali ka zikr lazim hain<br> Khudawaley yah par hain,nabi ka zikr lazim hain<br> Aliwaley ki shaadi hain,Ali ka zikr lazim hain<br> Koi milad karte hain<br> Koi milad karte hain, koi mehfil sajate hain<br> Mubarak ho...x2<br> Ali ke....Jahan shaadi....<br> <br> Jahan ho zikr e Zehra,<br> Aasman aisi zameen hogi<br> Wahan mahaul me bhi pakeezgi bhi bil yaqeen hogi<br> Ali ki manqabat hogi toh mausiqi nahi hogi<br> Gunahon se har ek takreeb<br> Gunahon se har ek takreeb, daamal bachate hain<br> Mubarak ho...x2<br> Ali ke...Jahan shadi...</p> 
  <p>Koi apni khushi ho panjetan ko shaad rakhte hain<br> Charage karke hum farshe aza abaad rakhte hain<br> Woh mehfil ho ke majlis karbala ko yaad rakhte hain<br> Tabarruk bhi khilate hain<br> Tabarruk bhi khilate hain toh paani bhi pilate hain<br> Mubarak ho...x2<br> Ali ke...Jahan shadi...</p> 
  <p>Farishton ne kaha mango dua, shaadi mubarak ho<br> Dulhan hain Binte Ahmed Fatema, shaadi mubarak ho<br> Khuda ke ghar ka dulha aa gaya, shaadi mubarak ho<br> Mubarakbaad dene ke<br> Mubarakbaad dene ke liye Jibreel aate hain<br> Mubarakx2<br> Ali ke...Jahan shaadi</p> 
  <p>Zamana daar par dekhe, zara Meesam ki daar aayi<br> Banaya daar ko mimbar,mili mae'raj goyaai<br> Ali ka qaul saccha hogaya hain,yeh khushi paayi<br> Zabaan jab kaati jati hain<br> Zaban jab kaati jati hain, toh Meesam muskurate<br> Mubarak ho...x2<br> Ali ke...Jahan</p> 
  <p>Suna Qur'an payi manzile mae'raj shaadi main<br> Suna Abbas ko dekha wafa ka raj shaadi mein<br> Hasi kitna hain maulai ke sar par, aaj shaadi mein<br> Ali.ka zikr sunne agaye hain aaj shaadi mein<br> Gale milte hain sab momin<br> Gale milte hain sab momin, hath bhi sabse milate hain<br> Mubarak ho...x2<br> Ali ke...Jahan shaadi...</p> 
  <p>Mubarak ho yeh shaadi, bas dua yeh hain meri maula<br> Payambar aur Khatija ki tarah rishta rahe saccha<br> Ali ke ishq main sanshaad woh har dam hasi dulha<br> Ata ho teri rehmat se dulhan ko seerate Zehra<br> Yaha duniya aur jannat me kayam rahe rishta<br> Mohabbat inme ho bas misle hubb e Aadam o Hawwa<br> Hain ek naemat to ek rehmat ,kamar beti ho ya beta<br> Bane aulaad inki naasirane lashkare maula<br> Utha kar haath Safdar, duaen dete jate hain<br> Mubarak ho....x2<br> Ali ke ....Jahan<br> Mubarak ho yeh shaadi</p> 
